        "text": "According to Kate Bartenwerfer, the petition asks whether the debt is dischargeable under 11\u202fU.S.C.\u202f\u00a7\u202f523(a)(2)(A), which bars discharge of a debt \u201cfor money obtained by actual fraud.\u201d"
